ullet\">First, listen to the clue.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Then, type in the verb you hear in the simple past or present perfect tense.</span>\n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.\n"}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le04ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le04ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le04ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Holly's - Your Life, Your Store</span><br/><br/>\n<span class=\"italic\">Company Description</span><br/>\nHolly's Inc. is a mid-range chain of department stores owned by Giorgio Farmani. It has been an innovative leader in the fashion industry for over 20 years. The company was founded by Giorgio Farmani and his late brother Ernesto Farmani in 1990 as a clothing factory.<br/>Since then, Holly's has developed into a global leader in the latest fashion designs. In 1995 we established our first subsidiary in Canada, and others followed. Our commitment has always been to the diversity to our apparel and to you, our loyal customers.<br/>"}, {"time": "48000", "image": "engenn6le04ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"italic\">More Recent Corporate Highlights</span><br/>\n<ul><li>1998: Established Holly's U.S. subsidiary</li>\n<li>2001: Released our most successful clothing line - \u201cDress to Impress\u201d </li>\n<li>2005: Started \u201cShop for A Cause\u201d Annual Charity Event </li></ul><br/>"}, {"time": "69000", "image": "engenn6le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"italic\">Philosophy and Mission</span> <br/>\nThe move from being a clothing factory to a department store has proved to be a very exciting part of our development. We have gained valuable experience and expertise, and we are proud to have grown into a multinational company. We started out as a small factory in Toronto, Canada, but we now feel we have a larger worldwide mission. Holly's philosophy has always been to be \u201cthe world's favourite for American style\u201d. Over the years, this mission has kept us focused on making meaningful products that not only exemplify our lifestyles, but enhance the ability to live it."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Look at the prompts below for some ideas about things you can include on your webpage.<br/>\n<span class=\"italic\">\n<ul><li>It  is a ... chain of ... owned by ... </li>\n<li>It's ... is in ... </li>\n<li>It has ... in ... </li>\n<li>It has been in the industry  for/since  </li>\n<li>It produces/ manufactures/ makes/ sells/ distributes  </li>\n<li>The company was ... by ... in ... </li>\n<li>Our commitment has always been to ... to our customers. </li>\n<li>It started out as a ... in ...</li>\n<li>The CEO/managing director/founder is ... </li></ul></span>"}], "video_src": "engenn7le04ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's New Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Company Page"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Writes short texts using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Writes short texts using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Producing Website Content Describing a Company"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The purpose of a company website is to <span class=\"strong\">advertise</span> and <span class=\"strong\">give information</span> to both existing and potential customers. A company website may include history, product information, as well as other features. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " An <span class=\"italic\">About Us</span> page highlights the company's description and mission, and provides information on current activities and products. Here's some language you can use to describe a company. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":14,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Company Description\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It  is a    <span class=\\\"strong\\\">small</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">medium-sized </span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">privately-owned</span> chain of <span  class=\\\"strong\\\">stores</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">agencies</span>   owned by ...    <br/><br/>Its  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">HQ</span>/<span  class=\\\"strong\\\">headquarters</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">head office</span> is  in ...      <br/>(*Headquarters is a plural noun used as a singular noun when referring to one company.) <br/>It has <span class=\\\"strong\\\">an office</span>/<span  class=\\\"strong\\\">a branch</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">a factory</span> in ...<br/><br/>It has been in the industry   <span class=\\\"strong\\\">for</span> 10 years / a decade / a while.<br/>It has been in the industry   <span class=\\\"strong\\\">since</span>     2000 / the early 50's <br/<br/>It  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">produces</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">manufactures</span>/<span  class=\\\"strong\\\">makes</span> clothing apparel. <br/>It <span class=\\\"strong\\\">sells</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">distributes</span>  clothing apparel/merchandise.<br/><br/>It  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">produces</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">manufactures</span>/<span  class=\\\"strong\\\">makes</span> apparel. <br/><br/>It <span class=\\\"strong\\\">sells</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">distributes</span>  apparel/merchandise.<br/><br/> The company was  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">founded</span> by ...    <br/>   The company was   <span class=\\\"strong\\\">set up</span> in ... <br/><br/>Our commitment has always been to ... <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">bring</span>  quality to our customers/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">deliver</span> superior customer service. <br/><br/>They  do   <span class=\\\"strong\\\">most</span>  of their business in  Canada.<br/>   They do  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">a lot of</span> business in South America.<br/><br/> It started out as a <span class=\\\"strong\\\">small factory</span>/ <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> family business</span> in Toronto.<br/><br/>Its most <span class=\\\"strong\\\">famous</span>  product in <span class=\\\"strong\\\">North America</span> is ...<br/> Its most  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">popular</span> product in <span class=\\\"strong\\\">the Middle East </span>is ...<br/><br/>The <span class=\\\"strong\\\">CEO</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">managing  director</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">founder</span> is ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Blue Banana Inc. <span class=\"strong\">is a privately-owned</span> chain of department stores <span class=\"strong\">owned by</span> Marco di Marco. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Its headquarters is in</span> Canada."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The company <span class=\"strong\">has been in the industry for</span> over 10 years. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">It was founded in</span> 1995 <span class=\"strong\">by</span> Angelo Mangiari.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">It manufactures</span> apparel. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Our commitment has always been to</span> deliver superior customer service. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Using the Present Perfect and the Simple Past Tense "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> to show a <span class=\"strong\">connection</span> between the  <span class=\"strong\">past</span> and the <span class=\"strong\">present</span>. If the situation is still relevant in the present, we often use <span class=\"strong\">for</span> or <span class=\"strong\">since</span> to say how long the situation has been true. <br/><br/> <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>It <span class=\"strong\">has been</span> an innovative leader in the fashion industry <span class=\"strong\">for</span> over 20 years.</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">Since 1990</span>, Holly's <span class=\"strong\">has developed</span> into a global leader in the latest fashion designs.</li></ul></span></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sometimes the speaker does <span class=\"underline\">not</span> mention the exact time something took place. The  <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> is used because the action happened at an <span class=\"underline\">indefinite</span> time in the past. In this case, we often use <span class=\"underline\">already</span>, <span class=\"underline\">ever</span>, <span class=\"underline\">never</span>, <span class=\"underline\">always</span>, <span class=\"underline\">yet</span> or <span class=\"underline\">just</span>.</br> <br/><ul><li><span class = \"italic\">Our commitment has <span class = \"strong\">always</span> been to diversity, to our apparel and to you, our loyal customers. </br><li><span class = \"italic\">We have <span class = \"strong\">already</span> established Holly's US subsidiary.</span></span></li>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Unlike the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span>, the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> refers to a  specific event completed in the past and tell you when it happened. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>The company <span class=\"strong\">was founded</span> by Giorgio Farmani and his late brother Ernesto Farmani in <span class=\"strong\">1990</span>.</li> <li><span class=\"strong\">In 1995</span> we <span class=\"strong\">established</span> our first subsidiary in Canada.</li></ul></span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "subsidiary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a company that is owned by another larger company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We established our first subsidiary in Canada."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are the words you use when creating a webpage for a company."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apparel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "clothes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our commitment has always been to bring diversity to our apparel. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "expertise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " special knowledge in a particular area, that you learn by experience or training"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our expertise in fashion has helped us immensely. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "multinational"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " in many different countries "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have grown into a multinational company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob08aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mission"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the most important aim of an organization"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Over the years, this mission has kept us focused. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob08aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exemplify"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be an example of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We will continue to make clothing that not only exemplifies our lifestyle but enhances it as well. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob08aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of an idea for a company you would like to start."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Brainstorm some ideas and come up with a name for your company."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give an overview  about your company. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about the history of your company."}, {"type": "text", "content": "What are the guiding principles of your company? Write them down."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use all the information you wrote down to create your webpage."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present it to your class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a webpage."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about experiences I've had."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about jobs and work."}]}]}